---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const datePublished = '2026-06-02';
const dateModified = '2026-08-17';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Wolvec" description="Wolvec privacy policy. Effective June 2, 2026.">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Privacy Policy",
      "url": "https://wolvec.ai/privacy",
      "datePublished": datePublished,
      "dateModified": dateModified,
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Wolvec L.L.C."
      }
    })} />
  </Fragment>
  <main class="pt-32 pb-24 px-6 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-2">Wolvec L.L.C., a Wyoming limited liability company</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-8">
        Effective Date: <time datetime={datePublished}>June 2, 2026</time>
        &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
        Last Updated: <time datetime={dateModified}>August 17, 2026</time>
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">1. Who We Are</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec L.L.C. ("Wolvec," "Company," "we," "us," or "our") is a fitness and wellness technology platform. We connect fitness coaches with their clients through AI-assisted coaching tools.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER: Wolvec is NOT a medical provider, health plan, or healthcare clearinghouse. Our platform provides fitness and wellness support only. Nothing on this platform constitutes medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Coach Data</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed space-y-1 mb-4">
        <li>Name and email address</li>
        <li>Coaching methodology, philosophy, and approach (provided during onboarding interview)</li>
        <li>Uploaded training content and methodology documents</li>
        <li>Nutrition coaching approaches and preferences</li>
        <li>Business preferences and coaching style</li>
        <li>Voice input recorded in the Platform in place of typing. Wolvec transmits the audio to its transcription provider and stores only the resulting text. Wolvec does not store the original audio recording.</li>
        <li>Billing information (processed by third-party payment processors)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Client Data</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed space-y-1 mb-4">
        <li>Name and email address</li>
        <li>Demographics (age, fitness level, goals)</li>
        <li>Fitness goals and training history</li>
        <li>Training progress, soreness reports, and mood check-ins</li>
        <li>Check-in responses, which may occasionally include mentions of pain, injury, or illness</li>
        <li>Workout logs and program completion data</li>
        <li>Voice input recorded in the Platform in place of typing. Wolvec transmits the audio to its transcription provider and stores only the resulting text. Wolvec does not store the original audio recording.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Automatically Collected Data</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed space-y-1 mb-4">
        <li>Device type and operating system</li>
        <li>IP address</li>
        <li>Usage data and interaction logs</li>
        <li>Error reports (via Sentry)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Google Sign-In Data</h3>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Google Sign-In Data: If you choose to sign in using Google, Wolvec may receive basic Google account information such as your name, email address, profile identifier, and profile image, depending on the permissions you authorize. Wolvec uses this information to authenticate your account, maintain account security, and operate the Platform.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Prospective Coach / Early Access Signup Data</h3>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Prospective Coach / Early Access Signup Data: name, email address, years coaching, approximate client count, current platform, and related information submitted through early-access or contact forms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">We use collected information to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed space-y-1 mb-4">
        <li>Generate and operate your AI coaching assistant based on coach methodology and preferences</li>
        <li>Deliver personalized fitness programs and coaching support</li>
        <li>Process check-in responses and provide coaching feedback</li>
        <li>Improve platform performance and reliability</li>
        <li>Communicate with you about your account and our services</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Account-Linked Usage and Behavioral Data for Platform Improvement</h3>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec may collect information about how coaches and clients interact with Platform features, such as screens visited, actions taken, session timing, feature use, and related event metadata. These records may remain linked to a user account through an internal identifier and are treated as personal data while they remain linkable.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec uses automated processes to remove or minimize certain personal details from behavioral-event payloads and uses the remaining information to improve Platform design, performance, reliability, and safety. Account-linked usage records remain subject to Wolvec's applicable retention and deletion practices.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Where usage or behavioral information contains or reveals consumer health data, Wolvec handles that information in accordance with the <a href="/consumer-health-data" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">Consumer Health Data Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">4. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec uses third-party service providers to operate core platform features. Your data is processed by:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li>Anthropic (AI text generation and reasoning): Coach and client content, including check-in responses and coaching conversations, is processed through Anthropic's Claude AI to generate coaching responses and program recommendations.</li>
        <li>OpenAI (voice transcription): When a Coach or a Client records voice input in the Platform, Wolvec transmits that audio recording to OpenAI's transcription service and receives back a text transcript. Wolvec stores the transcript. Wolvec does not store the original audio.</li>
        <li>OpenAI (text embeddings): Coach onboarding and methodology content may be transmitted to OpenAI to generate text embeddings, which Wolvec stores. Wolvec does not currently use these embeddings to generate coaching responses.</li>
        <li>Resend (email delivery): Agreement confirmation emails containing coach and client names and email addresses are sent via Resend's email delivery service.</li>
        <li>Neon (database storage): Your account data, program data, check-in responses, and coaching content are stored in Wolvec's managed database hosted by Neon, a serverless PostgreSQL provider.</li>
        <li>Vercel (platform operations): The Wolvec application is hosted and served by Vercel. Requests to the platform are processed through Vercel's serverless compute infrastructure.</li>
        <li>Neon (early access applications): If you submit the early access application form on our marketing site, your submission (name, email address, and coaching background responses) is stored in Wolvec's managed PostgreSQL database hosted by Neon, a serverless PostgreSQL provider, until we process your application.</li>
        <li>Cloudflare (security): Cloudflare provides edge security, DDoS protection, and web application firewall services. Cloudflare may process request metadata, including IP addresses, as part of security screening.</li>
        <li>Sentry provides error monitoring and performance diagnostics. Wolvec configures its systems to exclude message bodies, health-screening responses, health content, session cookies, IP addresses, and other personal information from error-monitoring transmissions where reasonably feasible. Sentry may process technical metadata needed for debugging, reliability, and security.</li>
        <li>Notion (bug triage and support): If you submit bug reports or feedback through the Platform, or if Wolvec staff engage in internal support workflows related to your account, report content, contact information, and related technical context may be processed in Notion for internal triage, debugging, and product support.</li>
        <li>Notification delivery providers: device identifiers used to deliver operational notifications.</li>
        <li>Google Sign-In / Google OAuth: Wolvec may use Google authentication services to allow users to create or access their Wolvec account. Google may process login-related information according to Google's own terms and privacy policies. Wolvec uses Google Sign-In only for authentication and account-access purposes.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Wolvec uses these providers to process data on Wolvec's behalf and does not authorize them to use the data for unrelated purposes.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">We do NOT sell your personal data. We do NOT disclose your data to third parties for purposes unrelated to operating the Wolvec platform.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">5. Consumer Health Data</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec handles certain health-adjacent and consumer health data, including PAR-Q+ screening responses, fitness goals, training history, workout logs, soreness or wellness check-ins, injury or illness disclosures, safety flags, and related coaching context.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec is not a medical provider, health plan, healthcare clearinghouse, physical therapy provider, mental health provider, or dietetics provider. The Platform does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, physical therapy, mental health counseling, or emergency support.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        For detailed information about the categories of consumer health data Wolvec collects, the purposes for collection and use, the parties with whom consumer health data may be shared, retention periods, consumer rights, and state-specific disclosures, please see Wolvec's <a href="/consumer-health-data" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">Consumer Health Data Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec does not sell consumer health data and does not use or share consumer health data for targeted advertising.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">Safety Controls</h3>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec uses limited automated safety controls for certain reports of pain, injury, illness, dizziness, chest or breathing symptoms, and other physical distress. Depending on the circumstances, those controls may pause AI-assisted coaching, display a safety notice, or flag the issue for the Client's assigned Coach in Wolvec. These controls may not identify every health or safety concern and are not medical or emergency monitoring.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-6 mb-3">FTC Health Breach Notification</h3>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec maintains procedures to evaluate and respond to security incidents and unauthorized disclosures involving identifiable health-related information. Because Wolvec is not regulated by HIPAA and handles health-related information through a fitness and wellness technology platform, Wolvec treats the FTC Health Breach Notification Rule as applicable where required.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        If Wolvec discovers a breach of unsecured identifiable health-related information subject to the FTC Health Breach Notification Rule, Wolvec will provide notices to affected individuals, the FTC, and, where required, media outlets, in accordance with applicable law.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        The FTC Health Breach Notification Rule may apply not only to traditional cybersecurity incidents, but also to unauthorized disclosures of identifiable health-related information. Violations may result in civil penalties as set by the FTC and adjusted periodically for inflation.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">6. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec retains personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy, to provide and secure the Platform, resolve disputes, maintain appropriate business and transaction records, and comply with applicable law.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Retention periods vary depending on the type of information and the reason it is processed.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Voice input is handled as follows. Wolvec does not retain the original audio of voice input. The audio is transmitted to Wolvec's transcription provider, the resulting text is stored, and the audio recording is not written to Wolvec's database, to file storage, or to disk.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Consumer health data is subject to the additional practices and applicable deletion rights described in Wolvec's Consumer Health Data Privacy Policy.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        When Wolvec receives a valid deletion request, Wolvec deletes covered information as required by applicable law, subject to applicable exceptions and permitted timing for backup or archived systems.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec may retain limited agreement-acceptance, billing, transaction, security, fraud-prevention, dispute, and legal records where reasonably necessary for those purposes and permitted by applicable law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">7. Data Security</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec uses administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards designed to protect personal information, including access controls and protections for data in transit and at rest where applicable.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        No system can be guaranteed completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">8. Privacy Rights and Consumer Health Data</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Depending on applicable law, you may have rights concerning personal information Wolvec maintains about you. Requests may be submitted to privacy@wolvec.ai.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Consumer health data is governed by Wolvec's standalone Consumer Health Data Privacy Policy, which describes applicable consumer-health-data rights, request procedures, and state-specific disclosures.
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec does not sell personal information or consumer health data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">9. International Users</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec currently accepts client accounts only from individuals whose country of residence is the United States. Coach access may be available from other countries where supported by Wolvec.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">10. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec is not directed to individuals under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from users under 18. If you believe someone under 18 has provided us with personal information, contact us at privacy@wolvec.ai and we will delete it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">11. Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Our platform may integrate with third-party services. This Privacy Policy does not cover third-party practices. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party services you use in connection with Wolvec.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Wolvec may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Wolvec will post the updated Policy with a revised "Last Updated" date. Where applicable law requires direct notice or consent before a change takes effect, Wolvec will provide that notice or obtain that consent as required.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-10 mb-4">13. Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">For privacy questions, requests, or concerns:</p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-1">Wolvec L.L.C.</p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@wolvec.ai" class="text-brand-accent hover:underline">privacy@wolvec.ai</a>
      </p>
      <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        For data deletion or access requests, include your full name and the email address associated with your account.
      </p>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
